    "title": "Will Sam's Club Be Open on Easter Sunday?",
    "text": "As Easter 2025 approaches, many consumers wonder, \"Will Sam's be open on Easter Sunday?\" After all, Walmart will be open on Easter Sunday, and this store is affiliated with Walmart. Unfortunately, Sam's Club will not be open on Easter Sunday.Many retailers are deciding to close on several holidays throughout the year. A few years ago, there was a big to-do about retailers seemingly opening every holiday and not giving their employees the opportunity to spend time with their families. Most retailers were specifically focused on Thanksgiving and Christmas. However, more are starting to close on other holidays throughout the year.SIGN UP for the Dengarden / Parade Home & Garden newsletter for a weekly dose of our favorite house hacks, decor trends and shopping dealsIs Sam's Club Open on Easter?Some retailers feel it is the right thing to do. Other retailers feel that holidays are great buying opportunities for last-minute shoppers and decide to stay open anyway. While Walmart will still be open, its associated store, Sam's Club, will not.Related: Sam's Club Is Selling Crochet Plant Craft Sets And They're Sure To Sell Out QuickWhy isn't Sam's opening their doors on Easter? It may be for the same reason that other stores like Costco, which sells similar products, are closing their doors. A retail blackout is the reason why stores like Sam's and Costco are closing for Easter Sunday. These stores are starting to take seriously the need for their employees to have time off on important holidays with family. Easter, like Christmas and Thanksgiving, happens to be one of those days.While many customers would love to go to Sam's to grab a few last-minute groceries for Easter dinner, such as ham, potato salad, fresh fruits, vegetables, and dairy, it won't be possible on Sunday. On a brighter note, customers are welcome to shop to their heart's content until closing Saturday night, getting all the food and home accessories they need.A word to the wise: make sure you get all that you need by Saturday or opt to buy from other places that will be open on Easter Sunday.Related: Sam's Club's Ultra-Handy Rack Organization System Has Shoppers Calling It 'Love at First Sight'",
